        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-03T07:51:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Lowsley brothers team up with many of Hugh's friends in Dok'Thorath to confront the spawn of Nigel's mind.</p><p>Advanced Heroic Infinitor vs Requital Captain Cosmic, Haka, Sky-Skraper and Tempest in Dok'Thorath.</p><p>Sloggy but fairly standard mint.</p><p>As is usual with Heroic Infinitor your goal here is to prevent Nigel from being hit. Spamming constructs to protect him from the Reapers, redirections (be careful of Enduring Intercession until you get Ta Moko, Energy Bracer and/or Aggression Modulator out. There are a lot of constructs to get hit), and healing. Just make sure Nigel doesn't get hit as that +2 burns through his HP fast.</p><p>Also note that the 0 damage from Portia's Concussive Clap is increased by the +2 so be judicious when you use it. Tempest gets an early Hailstorm so it doesn't hurt too much to give up the area damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:07.398Z",
