        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-03T13:21:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. Fun game.</p><p>I did a practice game with these heroes and struggled. Here, the star was the double Reclaim From the Deep. Play one to get the other and keep bringing Thorathian Monolith back. Between that and Enduring Intercession, I kept Infinitor at 15 for a long, long time (long enough to see some of the manifestations at -15). All the other heroes finished in that range as well.</p><p>A bit sloggy waiting for Infinitor to draw a AOE card, but I was in no danger.</p>",
