        "id": 215911,
        "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-03T15:24:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pretty Bog-Standard Heroic Infinitor Mint.</p><p>Similar to above, this game is all about keeping damage off Infinitor until he <em>finally</em> starts playing damaging cards (in my game he had to go through his entire deck twice to get them. Once was just manifestations, the second was just cards that look for manifestations and discard everything else). Aggression Modulator, Enduring Intercession, Thorian Monolith and all the various \"Reduce damage taken by 1\"s out there are your friends. Cosmic Crest allows CC to tank the Misshapen guys and Thorian Military&nbsp;easily.</p><p>Ended mid 20s for everyone except Haka and Infinitor who were mid teens. I think some of the manifestations were at -20 by the end :P</p><p>~Komori</p>",
