        "created_at": "2018-04-03T16:37:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Why would anyone play Enduring Intercession?\" the game!</p><p>Comfortable Mint. With all the redirects and DR, it's easy to keep the Refugees alive and keep digging for all the stuff you need. Speaking of Aggression Modulator, put a Dynamic Siphon on Sky-Scraper when she's small for that feel-good instant nerfing of environment damage. :)</p>",
