        "name": "Demiher0",
        "username": "Demiher0",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/demiher0/{size}/1931_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-04T08:54:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As per usual I really enjoyed playing heroic infinitor… Even if I messed up so hard turn one I could never recover in game one and he flipped for the first time ever.  After losing to Oblivaeon lite I got a near mint on not having all my constructs blown up in turn one and three by requital</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:28.428Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
