        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "As per usual I really enjoyed playing heroic infinitor.... Even if I messed up so hard turn one I could never recover in game one and he flipped for the first time ever.  After losing to Oblivaeon lite I got a near mint on not having all my constructs blown up in turn one and three by requital",
